'orient-express':[['Mary Debenham','A passenger with a guarded past','Self-controlled and watchful, wanting privacy while understanding that silence shapes the fate of others.'],['Dr. Arbuthnot','A physician and skeptical witness','Protective and principled, questioning whether official rules always deliver a just result.'],['Monsieur Bouc','A railway director with influence','Sociable but under pressure, discovering that fairness is more than keeping order.']]
